/* =====================================================================
   WEAPONS — Cyberpunk 2077 patch 2.31 + Phantom Liberty
   Source: the Cyberpunk Wiki weapon pages (each entry's `src`), read 2026-09-30.
   id      the game's internal item id (wiki "BaseID", first variant); never change it
   type    weapon type · tech = Power / Tech / Smart / Blade / Blunt / Thrown
   iconic  unique weapon, tracked in Gear › Weapons · miss = missable · dep = depends on choices
   lowe    Herold Lowe (Dogtown, Phantom Liberty) sells it if you missed it
   effect  the iconic effect (or a grenade's effect) · intrinsic = built-in behaviour
   stats   base stats as the wiki lists them (they scale with tier in game):
           dmg per hit · aps attacks/s · rel reload s · rng effective range · hnd handling
           mag magazine · hs headshot multiplier % · ap armor penetration % · wt weight
           grenades: dmg (highest tier) · rad radius m
   get     where to get it (wiki "source", or its Acquisition section)
   from    mission ids it comes from, for linking to the Journal
   img     picture on the wiki (loaded when viewed, cached on the device; not stored in the repo)
   ===================================================================== */
